Butterfly Hadamard kernel for int4 KV at head_dim 256.

The quantizer's dense Hadamard tiers need `2*D^2` bytes of shared memory, which
is 128 KiB at head_dim 256 and does not fit in Turing's 64 KiB. This gathers the
same log2(D) in-register stages into one launch, in the same order and in fp32,
with the working set capped at 32 KiB per program.

--- a/v1/attention/ops/int4_per_token_head.py
+++ b/v1/attention/ops/int4_per_token_head.py
@@ -1084,6 +1084,83 @@
